{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01735","headline":"杂曲歌辞 壮士行 · 施肩吾","name":"杂曲歌辞 壮士行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一斗之胆撑脏腑，如磥之筋碍臂骨。\n有时误入千人丛，自觉一身横突兀。\n当今四海无烟尘，胸襟被压不得伸。\n冻枭残虿我不取，污我匣黑青蛇鳞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"施肩吾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01735.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01735","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}